  "ruleText": "Puc 203.16 Public Comment. The commission shall provide persons who are not a party or a participant in a proceeding, but having interest in the subject matter, with an opportunity to state their position.\n\nSource. #2011, eff 5-4-82; ss by #2912, eff 11-26-84; ss by #4998, eff 11-26-90; ss by #6365, INTERIM, eff 11-18-96, EXPIRED: 3-18-97\n\nNew. #6559, eff 8-19-97, EXPIRES: 8-19-06\n\nNew. #8420, INTERIM, eff 8-23-05, EXPIRED: 2-19-06\n\nNew. #8657-A, eff 6-10-06\n\nNew. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 203.18)",
